{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30595","headline":"宴韦侍御新亭 · 林滋","name":"宴韦侍御新亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟磴披青霭，风筵藉紫苔。\n花香凌桂醑，竹影落藤桮。\n鸣籁将歌远，飞枝拂舞开。\n未愁留兴晚，明月度云来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林滋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}